## Apollo

[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/0aab19877fe18e934963918a7cb4f80364adc22d.png]]((Apollo - A Cut Above announcement art))

After weeks of waiting, Apollo finally graces us with his presence. With __Flawless Advance__ the fencer begins his approach, timing his strikes perfectly to inflict more damage. Counter-attacks aren't a concern for Apollo, as a flourish of his blade deflects the damage and triggers a quick __Riposte__, and __Disengaging Sigil__ allows him to jump out of the fray with ease. For his final blow, Apollo dons his fencer's mask and channels Ixia's might with __Itani Lo Sahn__, leaving enemies defeated in his wake. - __"Sa la rex vogali!"__

With Apollo's release, that concludes the rollout of our [[https://www.playdeadlock.com/oldgods]]((Old Gods, New Blood)) update. Thank you to everyone for the warm welcome of our new Patrons, getting your hands dirty in Street Brawl, and voting for your favorite heroes!

### Voting Stats:

- 60,776,963 total votes were cast across the event
- Exactly 600 people had the foresight to only vote for the eventual winner each round
- The largest winning margin was Venator over Celeste at 11%
- The highest number of votes cast by an individual player was 813... and every single one was for Celeste